{"id":"e4bbd2ac00e2ea21","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-ip-equals-pspace.md","title":"thm-ip-equals-pspace (IP = PSPACE)","display":"thm-ip-equals-pspace (IP = PSPACE)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-ip]]","[[28-df-pspace]]","[[28-df-tqbf]]"],"display":"thm-ip-equals-pspace (IP = PSPACE)","label":"28-thm-ip-equals-pspace","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-ip-equals-pspace","IP = PSPACE","Interactive proofs equal polynomial space"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 8.19","source_printed_pages":"157–162","source_pdf_pages":"183–188","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b39f28135327595\" href=\"?note=0b39f28135327595\" title=\"28-df-ip\">28-df-ip</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3545f8c2a4ed307\" href=\"?note=e3545f8c2a4ed307\" title=\"28-df-tqbf\">28-df-tqbf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ip-equals-pspace (IP = PSPACE)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-ip-equals-pspace"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-ip-equals-pspace</span><span>IP = PSPACE</span><span>Interactive proofs equal polynomial space</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 8.19"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"157–162"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"183–188"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{IP}\">\\(\\mathbf{IP}\\)</span> uses polynomially bounded verifier time, randomness, rounds, and communication</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\)</span> is deterministic polynomial space</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TQBF}\">\\(\\mathrm{TQBF}\\)</span> is the true quantified Boolean formula language</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{IP}=\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{IP}=\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>已读 arithmetization 的协议陈述和核心逐轮保持错误界论证；未完整复核所有 TQBF 低度化算子实现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{IP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf{IP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\)</span>, a polynomial-space machine recursively maximizes acceptance over prover messages and averages over verifier coin tosses, reusing space across the polynomial-depth interaction tree.</p>\n<p>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathbf{IP}\">\\(\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathbf{IP}\\)</span>, arithmetization of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TQBF}\">\\(\\mathrm{TQBF}\\)</span> over a sufficiently large finite field and repeated low-degree consistency tests give an interactive protocol with completeness at least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2/3\">\\(2/3\\)</span> and soundness at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/3\">\\(1/3\\)</span>; polynomial-time reductions then transfer the protocol to every PSPACE language.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Theorem 8.19，印刷页 157–162；PDF 页 183–188。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R6证据边界：TQBF低度化算子与完整协议实现尚未独立核验。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ip","status":"resolved","id":"0b39f28135327595","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ip]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tqbf","status":"resolved","id":"e3545f8c2a4ed307","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tqbf]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{IP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TQBF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{IP}=\\mathbf{PSPACE}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{IP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathbf{IP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TQBF}","display":false},{"tex":"2/3","display":false},{"tex":"1/3","display":false}],"bytes":1988,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"协议刻画：[[28-thm-public-coin-ip]]、[[28-thm-ip-equals-pspace]]、[[28-thm-mip-equals-nexp]]。"}],"outgoing":["0b39f28135327595","fd829148f31abddc","e3545f8c2a4ed307"]}